CEFR level labels
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The CEFR level (A1–C2) attached to each English headword is DERIVED from:

  - CEFR-J Wordlist — Tono, Y. et al., https://cefr-j.org/
    Licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0.
  - Octanove Vocabulary Profile (C1/C2), Open Language Profiles,
    https://github.com/openlanguageprofiles/olp-en-cefrj
    Licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0.

Only a single derived level label per word is included in this repository; the
original datasets (the CSV files) are NOT redistributed here. They are fetched
at build time (see build/fetch-sources.js and build/sources.lock.json) and
remain under their own CC BY-SA 4.0 license. The derivation is reproducible and
documented in build/README.md.

This is attribution, not legal advice. If you redistribute the source datasets
themselves, you must comply with CC BY-SA 4.0 for those files.

